# Vendored Ansible roles for offline builds
#
# This directory should contain cloned Git repositories of required Ansible roles:
# - Windows-2019-STIG (from ansible-lockdown)
# - Windows-2022-STIG (from ansible-lockdown)
# - RHEL8-STIG (from ansible-lockdown)
# - RHEL9-STIG (from ansible-lockdown)
# - AL2023-STIG (RHEL9-STIG fork adapted for Amazon Linux 2023, used as fallback)
#
# To populate this directory, run from a system with internet access:
#   cd spel/ansible/roles
#   git clone https://github.com/ansible-lockdown/Windows-2019-STIG.git
#   git clone https://github.com/ansible-lockdown/Windows-2022-STIG.git
#   git clone https://github.com/ansible-lockdown/RHEL8-STIG.git
#   git clone https://github.com/ansible-lockdown/RHEL9-STIG.git
#   # AL2023-STIG is already included in the repository
